OL,3,GNEWSASome media firms evacuated after
OL,4,Ahoax bomb threats
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of high-profile media
OL,7,Forganisations, including Ireland's
OL,8,Fpublic service broadcaster RTE, were
OL,9,Fevacuated because of bomb threats on
OL,10,FFriday morning.
OL,12,FStaff at the Irish Independent
OL,13,Fnewspaper and Dublin-based radio
OL,14,Fstation NewstalkFM also left their
OL,15,Foffices for a short time after
OL,16,Freceiving threats by email.
OL,18,FThe Irish government has described the
OL,19,Fbomb warnings as "hoax threats" and
OL,20,Fsaid the authorities were "working to
OL,21,Festablish who is responsible".
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
